# Task 2 report

## Files

- Modified `core/pit_diagnosis/models.py` with immutable partition, experiment, catalog, and identity types.
- Added `core/pit_diagnosis/catalog.py` with fixed partitions, canonical catalog loading, and identity construction.
- Added `config/pit_diagnosis_experiments_v1.json` containing the approved 21 D0-D5 experiments.
- Added `tests/test_pit_diagnosis_catalog.py`.

## Decisions

The three date partitions are fixed to discovery 2021-01-01 through 2023-12-31, validation 2024-01-01 through 2024-12-31, and locked evaluation 2025-01-01 through 2025-12-31. D0-D4 records each declare exactly one changed causal dimension; D5 is empty in JSON and controller-composed. Catalog loading uses Task 1 canonical JSON and SHA-256 helpers and rejects unknown rule IDs, diagnostic-only promotion, malformed records, and invalid composition.

