## Commit

`7a1f6d6` — `feat: define bounded PIT diagnosis experiments`.

## Concerns

No functional concerns. The existing pytest configuration emits an unrelated `cache_dir` warning when cacheprovider is disabled.

## Round 1 reviewer fixes

Experiment identity normalization now includes every experiment schema field (including changed dimensions, cited rules, promotion/controller/code flags, and variants), and recursively freezes nested identity fields. Experiment phases are closed to D0-D5, D5 rejects pre-composed dimensions/variants, and direct catalog construction validates non-empty version and lowercase SHA-256 metadata. Added regressions for identity collisions, invalid phase/D5 shape, malformed metadata, and nested immutability.

